invariant: INV-69
file: src/keccak_neon_round.h
catches: test/docker-aes-runtime-qemu.sh keccak-neon
reason: chi's first lane of each row reads its two neighbours in the wrong
  order, b0 ^ (~b2 & b1). Both forms run the text, and the
  equivalence test compares each with sha3.c's stream.

--- old
        a0 = kn_bcax(b0, b2, b1);
--- new
        a0 = kn_bcax(b0, b1, b2);
